WEBVTT

00:13.930 --> 00:18.351
Those who ceaselessly hone
their killing arts are known as "Masters."

00:18.768 --> 00:23.732
After many generations,
they have gained lethal abilities

00:23.815 --> 00:26.317
called "Modified Bloodlines."

00:27.068 --> 00:32.365
This is the story of one such Master,
the Poison Master, Hikaru Gero,

00:32.741 --> 00:35.326
and his attempts to get married.

00:43.793 --> 00:47.255
Locked in Latata

00:47.338 --> 00:50.925
Secrets in my veins Latata

00:51.009 --> 00:52.719
I know you want it

00:52.802 --> 00:54.512
And sure, I love it

00:54.596 --> 00:58.767
So I stay behind the mask Latata

00:58.850 --> 01:02.103
Run, run, run back to back Run

01:02.187 --> 01:05.982
Fun, fun, fun unpredictable but fun

01:06.066 --> 01:08.193
At the end of every mind game

01:08.276 --> 01:12.155
Shoot through the darkened night

01:12.238 --> 01:15.366
Poisoned in our bodies still

01:15.450 --> 01:20.038
Laugh at us our reckless souls

01:20.121 --> 01:21.372
TOXIC

01:21.456 --> 01:23.666
For you I will

01:23.750 --> 01:24.959
TOXIC

01:25.043 --> 01:27.378
Rewrite my destiny

01:27.462 --> 01:30.882
Losing it, falling for you

01:30.965 --> 01:34.344
What's tomorrow Kill or Kiss

01:34.427 --> 01:35.553
TOXIC

01:35.637 --> 01:37.889
Tell me what you want

01:37.972 --> 01:39.140
TOXIC

01:39.224 --> 01:41.434
I'll stay right here

01:41.518 --> 01:44.896
Like a spell, I'll be by your side

01:44.979 --> 01:48.650
What you gonna do Kill or Kiss

01:52.570 --> 01:55.156
Kill or Kiss

01:56.241 --> 01:58.701
Kill or Kiss

01:59.786 --> 02:02.038
Kill or Kiss

02:08.503 --> 02:11.965
It's the moment you've all been
waiting for: the test of courage.

02:12.048 --> 02:14.425
Your destination is
that shrine over there!

02:14.509 --> 02:15.677
Or so I'd like to say.

02:15.760 --> 02:17.929
But it's dangerous for
non-supernatural reasons,

02:18.012 --> 02:20.223
so we put a photo stand-in partway.

02:20.974 --> 02:25.353
We'll be handing out selfie sticks,
so take pictures there in pairs.

02:25.895 --> 02:27.605
Don't forget the flash.

02:28.064 --> 02:32.902
Okay, everybody! Let's all make memories
we'll treasure for a lifetime!

02:46.166 --> 02:48.668
Gero, this is your big chance.

02:48.751 --> 02:51.796
Heard of the "suspension bridge effect"?
It's when you cross one

02:51.880 --> 02:55.884
and mistake your heart racing in fear
for liking the person you're with.

02:55.967 --> 02:57.343
Ghosts work the same way.

02:57.427 --> 02:58.887
Uh, okay.

02:58.970 --> 03:01.431
The mood is key. Got that?

03:01.723 --> 03:03.975
You've gotta seize
this kind of opportunity,

03:04.058 --> 03:06.519
or you'll never get a girlfriend.

03:06.603 --> 03:09.188
Why does Kinosaki seem so into this?

03:09.272 --> 03:11.482
I know I asked for help
getting married, but still...

03:18.197 --> 03:19.908
Thanks very much.

03:20.283 --> 03:22.702
Thank you for sticking with me for this.

03:23.453 --> 03:26.664
This is honestly a total pain, right?

03:27.165 --> 03:29.208
If I'd just stayed put at home,

03:30.001 --> 03:33.087
it would've made your job a lot easier.

03:33.171 --> 03:34.672
It doesn't matter.

03:35.715 --> 03:39.385
Actually, a place like this does more
to limit the means of attack.

03:40.386 --> 03:43.681
If I were to ask you
to do one thing for me,

03:44.224 --> 03:48.311
it would be to forget all your worries
and just enjoy the trip.

03:52.398 --> 03:55.401
You only get so many opportunities
like this in your life.

03:56.444 --> 04:00.448
There's no need to waste this one
just because someone wants you dead.

04:01.574 --> 04:03.368
That's why I'm here.

04:04.410 --> 04:05.662
Mr. Gero.

04:09.540 --> 04:10.875
Must be the photo stand-in.

04:12.502 --> 04:16.005
Is this the "selfie stick"?
How does it work?

04:16.089 --> 04:18.132
Oh, I'll take the picture.

04:19.175 --> 04:22.136
Ready? Okay. Abomasum!

04:37.110 --> 04:38.152
Mr. Gero?

04:42.991 --> 04:44.075
Mr. Gero?

04:45.118 --> 04:47.787
I need to find Mr. Gero.

04:48.621 --> 04:50.039
I need to find him.

04:54.252 --> 04:55.461
Mr. Gero!

04:57.797 --> 04:58.631
Thank good-

06:30.807 --> 06:31.808
Shiori.

06:36.687 --> 06:40.775
D-Dad? But how?

06:41.526 --> 06:47.323
You're hovering between life and death
as an offering to Lord Chladni.

06:48.491 --> 06:52.745
I never imagined I'd get a chance
to drink with you like this.

06:53.955 --> 06:57.125
D-Dad, why...

06:57.208 --> 06:59.710
Why did you name me your successor?

07:03.881 --> 07:06.342
I shouldn't have!

07:07.718 --> 07:11.264
I gave you too much credit
because you're my daughter.

07:11.347 --> 07:13.850
That was a mistake!

07:14.517 --> 07:16.310
Deep down, you realize that, don't you?

07:16.853 --> 07:22.817
Trying to do something that's beyond you
will only make you suffer, Shiori.

07:29.657 --> 07:33.327
You can never become strong.

07:33.953 --> 07:36.539
Just let go.

07:39.083 --> 07:45.590
Living up to my expectations
and everyone else's must be hard on you.

07:47.925 --> 07:49.844
(Hard on you)

07:51.095 --> 07:52.889
(Hard on you)

07:53.473 --> 07:56.767
I want to take it easy.

07:56.851 --> 07:58.644
(Hard on you)

08:03.858 --> 08:05.193
I really...

08:05.651 --> 08:06.486
Yes.

08:08.529 --> 08:11.491
But more than that...

08:12.283 --> 08:14.994
I was glad that I made everyone happy!

08:17.997 --> 08:21.584
Maybe no amount of pushing myself
will make me strong,

08:21.918 --> 08:25.421
but I still want to improve myself.

08:25.922 --> 08:28.216
I won't run away!

08:32.094 --> 08:34.764
I'm so high up. I'm gonna die.

08:35.806 --> 08:37.225
What should I do? How can I save myself?
The river's too shallow.

08:37.308 --> 08:39.435
What's in my backpack? The selfie stick.
Photo stand-in. Bran snacks. Throat lozenges.

08:39.519 --> 08:40.561
Umbrella.

08:42.146 --> 08:43.606
My collapsible umbrella!

08:44.482 --> 08:45.566
So much for that!

08:45.858 --> 08:50.571
I'll be letting down everyone
who's protected me if I die here.

08:51.030 --> 08:52.615
I've got to do something.

08:52.990 --> 08:53.950
Something like...

09:04.460 --> 09:06.754
This is that stuff from the party.

09:07.421 --> 09:09.215
Water-absorbent polymer.

09:12.677 --> 09:15.721
They need to make it look
like suicide or an accident,

09:15.972 --> 09:20.601
or your relatives will become suspects
and risk more than just the inheritance.

09:21.727 --> 09:28.734
That's why they planned it so thoroughly,
including the "legend" of Lord Chladni.

09:28.985 --> 09:30.820
You made it up, right...

09:33.030 --> 09:35.408
Sound Master Naruko?

09:40.580 --> 09:42.248
It was a clever trick, Sound Master.

09:42.623 --> 09:45.543
The moment she took that picture
in the photo stand-in...

09:45.876 --> 09:47.712
Mr. Gero? Mr. Gero?

09:48.212 --> 09:51.007
Then, you hit me with a shock wave,

09:51.549 --> 09:53.259
scrambled my sense of direction,

09:53.342 --> 09:55.511
and separated me from Ureshino.

09:56.012 --> 09:58.306
You're in better shape than I thought.

09:59.557 --> 10:01.559
I'll super enjoy this.

10:03.019 --> 10:04.145
Don't worry.

10:04.687 --> 10:10.318
Suicide or accident. I'll super dance
to the tune we call the rules.

10:13.154 --> 10:15.615
Ureshino, it's too risky
to hang around here.

10:15.698 --> 10:16.907
We're going to break through!

10:17.199 --> 10:19.410
I c-can't stand.

10:20.244 --> 10:21.579
My knees gave out.

10:22.788 --> 10:24.290
Oh, fine.

10:25.625 --> 10:26.959
Hop on.

10:27.043 --> 10:29.420
I should be used to this,
thanks to Kinosaki.

10:29.879 --> 10:31.547
I showed him the ropes.

10:38.512 --> 10:40.348
Is this right?

10:41.599 --> 10:42.808
Forget it.

10:43.517 --> 10:45.102
Hang on tight!

10:45.186 --> 10:46.145
Right!

10:50.691 --> 10:56.197
Modified Bloodline++: Mind Whisper.

10:57.865 --> 10:59.325
What's happening?

10:59.575 --> 11:01.118
If I had to guess...

11:01.452 --> 11:03.537
he's messing with our minds.

11:03.621 --> 11:05.623
(Upper, Back, Lower)

11:11.045 --> 11:13.798
Physical condition: fortissimo.

11:13.881 --> 11:18.260
So this is the secret Modified Bloodline
of the Poison Masters.

11:19.095 --> 11:25.351
I'm super honored to feel
your poison increment vibes.

11:25.851 --> 11:30.439
But my Mind Whispers can reach you
anywhere on this mountain.

11:30.689 --> 11:32.858
Escape is super impossible.

11:32.942 --> 11:35.403
Ureshino, take these earplugs.

11:36.570 --> 11:39.365
M-Mr. Gero, I've got just the thing.

11:40.658 --> 11:45.079
Noise-cancelling headsets.
We can pair them and talk to each other.

11:45.162 --> 11:46.038
(Meow!)

11:46.455 --> 11:48.040
It looks great on you.

11:48.124 --> 11:49.458
(Meow!)

11:49.542 --> 11:52.378
Blocking your ears is a bad move.

11:52.461 --> 11:56.924
When my Mind Whispers build up,
their blades of sound...

11:57.466 --> 11:59.176
shred flesh.

11:59.593 --> 12:01.387
You look stupid in cat ears.

12:07.143 --> 12:08.561
Don't listen.

12:08.644 --> 12:10.354
Dodge with your skin.

12:12.356 --> 12:16.402
I'll up my strength and sharpen
my skin sensitivity to the max.

12:17.486 --> 12:19.530
Toxin: Lunar Peak.

12:23.284 --> 12:24.785
No big deal.

12:25.077 --> 12:27.663
You're not my target.

12:33.502 --> 12:34.670
Ureshino?

12:35.171 --> 12:38.507
No way. Attacking me wasn't his real goal?

12:38.841 --> 12:41.260
He vibrated the headphones themselves?

12:45.181 --> 12:47.183
Just as I thought.

12:47.266 --> 12:52.813
It's not just with her father.
This girl is a treasure trove of trauma.

12:52.897 --> 12:58.152
I can break her will again
and again and again.

13:01.322 --> 13:02.198
Ureshino!

13:07.703 --> 13:09.038
Uncle Mitsuhiko?

13:09.121 --> 13:10.748
You must have realized...

13:11.332 --> 13:17.171
that I see you as a burden.

13:17.713 --> 13:24.011
All that work, plus convincing
shareholders left me exhausted.

13:25.304 --> 13:28.849
That's why your uncle
let you take this trip.

13:28.933 --> 13:32.520
He got on board with the plan to kill you.

13:33.646 --> 13:35.606
No one is on your side-

13:38.484 --> 13:40.194
That's a load of bull!

13:45.950 --> 13:51.330
Your uncle interviewed a ton of bodyguards
before he hired me.

13:52.373 --> 13:56.710
He kept hiring scumbags
with no clue what they were doing.

13:56.794 --> 14:01.423
He got burned and had to pay
a fortune to cancel every time.

14:02.758 --> 14:04.927
He only reached out to me...

14:05.261 --> 14:07.638
because he read a long-ass
10,000 character review,

14:07.721 --> 14:10.975
and figured you'd be safe with me.

14:11.892 --> 14:15.354
Would a guy who sees you
as a burden go that far?

14:18.732 --> 14:19.817
You're right.

14:22.194 --> 14:25.739
Sorry, Ureshino. I need you to take a nap.

14:27.533 --> 14:33.956
I should've known a Poison Master
would outdo me on hallucinations.

14:34.039 --> 14:36.542
I know you're listening, Naruko.

14:37.418 --> 14:42.298
Your illusions and brainwashing
reach into people's psyches

14:42.381 --> 14:44.925
draw out traumatic memories and feelings,
and amplify them.

14:45.551 --> 14:48.429
It's true that Ureshino has
a boatload of mental scars,

14:48.512 --> 14:51.849
and that her uncle okayed this trip,

14:51.932 --> 14:55.769
but that's just one little part of them.

14:56.854 --> 15:00.399
Her uncle only felt tempted
for a moment. You amped it up.

15:01.150 --> 15:03.777
Ureshino knows her own weaknesses,

15:04.111 --> 15:06.280
and she's fighting to overcome them.

15:08.282 --> 15:09.366
So...

15:11.368 --> 15:14.580
Stop giving her a hard time.

15:17.082 --> 15:19.043
(Lord Chladni)

15:24.298 --> 15:26.133
That's weird.

15:26.216 --> 15:29.595
Gero and Ureshino
should be around here.

15:31.472 --> 15:34.183
Gero! Ureshino!

15:34.433 --> 15:35.267
What the heck is-

15:35.351 --> 15:37.394
(Why the ears?!
Why carry her like that?!)

15:37.645 --> 15:40.105
So that's why you were running late.

15:40.189 --> 15:42.483
I'm glad I put a GPS tracker on her.

15:42.858 --> 15:44.735
Courtesy of me.

15:45.402 --> 15:46.987
Are you okay, Gero?

15:47.321 --> 15:48.948
I pushed myself a bit.

15:49.031 --> 15:50.616
GPS?

15:50.699 --> 15:55.079
Forget that. Kinosaki, take Ureshino
and get away from this village.

15:55.162 --> 15:55.996
Okay.

15:56.080 --> 15:57.498
Wait, what?

15:57.581 --> 15:59.625
Given the nature of his mission,

15:59.708 --> 16:02.378
he should try to eliminate me first.

16:03.045 --> 16:05.089
I've spoiled his plans twice now.

16:06.006 --> 16:08.384
I'll go take out Naruko.

16:08.884 --> 16:12.930
I want you to keep
Ureshino safe while I do.

16:13.013 --> 16:16.934
Hang on. I'm just your marriage advisor.

16:19.269 --> 16:20.813
Just this once, okay?

16:20.896 --> 16:23.607
You're gonna treat me to some
pricey as hell sushi after this.

16:23.899 --> 16:24.817
Thanks.

16:24.900 --> 16:26.026
Okay. Let's go.

16:28.779 --> 16:30.030
Wait, Ureshino.

16:31.907 --> 16:33.075
I knew it.

16:33.617 --> 16:36.412
He risked getting close
so he could plant this

16:37.079 --> 16:41.083
and send her stronger hallucinations
and brainwashing.

16:41.792 --> 16:43.752
What do Naruko's techniques need?

16:43.836 --> 16:45.713
I don't have a complete
handle on them yet.

16:47.006 --> 16:47.965
This will be fun.

16:48.507 --> 16:50.801
If you're going to fight
while staying hidden,

16:50.884 --> 16:52.511
I'll drag you out into the open.

16:53.804 --> 16:55.347
Super bad news.

16:55.806 --> 17:01.353
If I chase the target now,
he might get me from behind instead.

17:02.646 --> 17:04.356
Super bad news.

17:04.690 --> 17:10.029
I'll take out the Poison Master first,
then take my time with Ureshino.

17:10.112 --> 17:11.739
That's the logical approach.

17:12.197 --> 17:14.992
I'm in peak condition.

17:16.076 --> 17:19.246
Let the climax begin.

17:21.749 --> 17:23.292
Weak. Loser. Unfit.

17:24.334 --> 17:26.462
He just got a whole lot more serious.

17:26.837 --> 17:30.924
Gas doesn't pack as much punch outside.

17:31.467 --> 17:34.303
Poison needles are useless
unless you get close.

17:35.262 --> 17:36.513
What's your move?

17:37.389 --> 17:41.185
Your moves won't work if I cut your wires.

17:42.352 --> 17:43.645
It bounced off?

17:44.772 --> 17:47.649
My strings vibrate at super high speeds.

17:47.983 --> 17:50.861
There's no way for liquid to get to them.

17:54.114 --> 17:56.408
The time is finally ripe.

18:18.972 --> 18:23.894
Modified Bloodline++: Grand Actor.

19:01.390 --> 19:03.934
It's not moving? Not even its legs?

19:04.351 --> 19:05.519
Why not?

19:05.936 --> 19:07.479
What did you do, Poison Master?

19:07.855 --> 19:09.940
Did you cut the trees
instead of the wires?

19:10.023 --> 19:12.776
No. I didn't sense anything like that.

19:12.860 --> 19:14.987
And you didn't wither them with poison.

19:15.529 --> 19:17.322
In fact, they're in perfect shape.

19:18.407 --> 19:20.784
Wait. Don't tell me...

19:24.705 --> 19:25.998
It looks like...

19:26.582 --> 19:28.834
your friends like my medicine.

19:29.209 --> 19:33.088
Your technique's weak point
is how hard it is to tune.

19:33.463 --> 19:38.635
You can't play precise notes
if the trees keep growing.

19:39.970 --> 19:41.305
Time for the finish.

19:45.934 --> 19:50.522
Fear lies dormant in the depths
of people's psyches.

19:51.899 --> 19:54.401
I've already sown the seeds.

19:55.819 --> 19:57.404
Now I only need...

19:58.822 --> 20:01.033
to make them grow.

20:03.118 --> 20:04.578
Hey, you two!

20:04.661 --> 20:06.413
We've got an emergency!

20:07.080 --> 20:08.290
No way.

20:08.373 --> 20:10.542
That's the only way out of here.

20:10.626 --> 20:13.629
Someone started feeling sick
during the test of courage,

20:13.712 --> 20:16.924
so we tried to drive them
to a hospital, but, well...

20:17.007 --> 20:19.134
Amateurs shouldn't trek
through mountains.

20:19.218 --> 20:20.510
Let's wait for rescue.

20:20.594 --> 20:22.012
H-Hey! Look there!

20:32.022 --> 20:33.732
Oh, good.

20:34.691 --> 20:36.860
It's the wrath of Lord Chladni!

20:36.944 --> 20:38.987
The curse was real!

20:39.071 --> 20:40.864
Disaster will strike us!

20:40.948 --> 20:42.616
Help!

20:43.033 --> 20:45.160
I don't wanna die!

20:46.203 --> 20:48.163
An offering.

20:49.498 --> 20:51.416
We need to follow the legend,

20:52.209 --> 20:56.004
and offer a child to Lord Chladni.

20:56.672 --> 20:59.967
The youngest person here
will be the child.

21:00.259 --> 21:04.429
We'll sacrifice whoever has
the latest birthday to Lord Chladni.

21:04.930 --> 21:08.225
New students, get out your IDs.

21:08.809 --> 21:10.811
September 27th.

21:10.894 --> 21:12.145
February 4th.

21:12.229 --> 21:13.563
October 10th.

21:13.647 --> 21:14.982
May 5th.

21:15.065 --> 21:16.817
March 20th.

21:18.360 --> 21:22.656
M-March 31st.

21:23.240 --> 21:28.912
At this point, nipping the panic
in the bud is super impossible.

21:28.996 --> 21:30.956
Grab her!

21:31.039 --> 21:32.624
She's getting away!

21:33.375 --> 21:34.710
Get back here, offering!

21:35.627 --> 21:39.548
It's only a matter of time
until my target dies.

21:40.173 --> 21:45.429
They'll never calm down
unless you stop me.

22:03.071 --> 22:04.614
Super complete.

22:07.534 --> 22:08.702
A violin?

22:10.329 --> 22:11.455
Is he gonna hit me...

22:12.873 --> 22:15.751
with the Sound Masters'
Modified Bloodline Increment?

22:28.722 --> 22:30.932
Ah! Something smells fishy!

22:31.016 --> 22:32.851
I'm shocked, startled,
it's adding insult to injury

22:32.934 --> 22:34.186
I'm completely obsessed

22:34.269 --> 22:36.563
Ah! Something smells off!

22:36.646 --> 22:38.565
You're all bluff,
I'm sick and tired, so disappointed

22:38.648 --> 22:39.691
Bye-bye, mwah!

22:39.983 --> 22:42.736
It seems like I'm only good at

22:42.819 --> 22:45.572
workbooks for a child

22:45.655 --> 22:48.325
Even through infectious disease,
I want to love with you

22:48.408 --> 22:51.286
No! No! Love's in gridlock!

22:51.369 --> 22:53.789
Forever and ever, I love you,
Shake Na Baby

22:53.872 --> 22:57.000
Darling, heading toward a twisted signpost

22:57.084 --> 22:59.503
Heart fluttering, I love you,
Shake Na Baby

22:59.586 --> 23:02.339
Just the two of us, consolation prize

23:12.599 --> 23:14.726
Ah, the scent of dance

23:14.810 --> 23:16.561
I'm completely obsessed

23:16.645 --> 23:17.979
with you as you flutter down

23:18.063 --> 23:20.232
Ah, something smells off

23:20.315 --> 23:22.442
I'm blown away by you

23:22.526 --> 23:23.443
Bye-bye, mwah!

23:23.527 --> 23:26.571
It seems like I'm only good at

23:26.655 --> 23:29.324
workbooks for a child

23:29.407 --> 23:32.160
I want us to share even our growing pains

23:32.244 --> 23:34.913
No! No! Love's in gridlock!

23:35.122 --> 23:37.624
Forever and ever, I love you,
Shake Na Baby

23:37.707 --> 23:40.710
Darling, heading toward
a stagnant signpost

23:40.794 --> 23:43.296
Heart fluttering, I love you,
Shake Na Baby

23:43.380 --> 23:46.133
Singing a grand chorus cheekily

23:47.634 --> 23:50.595
This world of ours
isn't as grimy as I thought.

23:51.555 --> 23:54.224
- Super bliss.
- Please. Just one more time.

23:54.307 --> 23:56.977
Next time: "Together With Me."
